 * own and deploy (agents, durable workflows, knowledge, the app, its users and
 * its record of what happened), not a hosted workspace or an assembly of
 * separately licensed services.
 *
 * Facts about the other products come from their own pricing, docs and
 * licence pages, checked in CHECKED_ON. The Microsoft list is assembled from
 * Microsoft's own pages; the count is ours, and the copy says so.
 */
